"""Download crane TTS, ASR, VAD, and LLM models from Hugging Face.

Examples:
    ./crane-model-download --list
    ./crane-model-download --model voxtral --path /srv/models
    ./crane-model-download --model qwen3-tts-customvoice-1.7b --path ~/models --token hf_...
    ./crane-model-download --model qwen3-asr-0.6b --path ~/models
    ./crane-model-download --model silero-vad --path ~/models
    ./crane-model-download --model qwen3.5-9b-gguf --path ~/models --quant Q8_0
    ./crane-model-download --model moonshine-g2p-en-us --path ~/models
    ./crane-model-download --model kokoro --path ~/models

Run directly (uv picks up the inline metadata above and manages the
`huggingface_hub` dependency in an ephemeral venv, no setup needed):

    uv run tools/crane-model-download --list

Without `uv`, install the dependency yourself and run with plain python3:

    pip install huggingface_hub
    python3 tools/crane-model-download --list

huggingface_hub >= 0.32.0 bundles the `hf-xet` accelerator by default,
which speeds up downloads automatically.
"""

